Output "assets/demo.gif"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "/tmp/aksdemo" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "e" Sleep 1s Type "nv" Sleep 1500ms Escape Sleep 1s
Type ":" Sleep 500ms Type "!echo hello from aksara" Sleep 1s Enter Sleep 2s Escape Sleep 1s
Type ":" Sleep 500ms Type 'w demo : "echo hi"' Sleep 1s Enter Sleep 1500ms
Type ":" Sleep 500ms Type "r demo" Sleep 1s Enter Sleep 1500ms
Type "q" Sleep 1s
